Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:46:38 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 116/121] RS2: sparse draft proposal and chain rejection
 sampling (SGLANG_OPT_SPEC_SPARSE_RS)

Default off. Under truncated rejection sampling with topk=1 single-layer
EAGLE/MTP, the draft keeps only its top-K support (SGLANG_RS_DRAFT_TOPK)
instead of a vocab-wide q, and verify walks the chain against the sparse
target support. Two Triton launches per draft step (partial top-k, finalize).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
